2026-10-06T21:00:57.8363398Z           {featureFlags.clientCalendar && (
2026-10-06T21:00:57.8363493Z             <Tab.Screen
2026-10-06T21:00:57.8363615Z               name=\"CalendarTab\"
2026-10-06T21:00:57.8363757Z               component={CalendarStackNavigator}
